# Plugin: Code Review

Purpose:
  Adapt code review skills for SDDRA R1 arm.

Adaptation:
  Requesting -> AI presents code for human review:
    Checklist: tests pass, linter passes, decision requirements met,
              security review passed, documentation updated

  Receiving -> Human feedback workflow:
    APPROVED -> proceed to next stage
    CHANGES_REQUESTED -> create revision task
    REJECTED -> archive task, create new decision

Usage:
  Chain: R1 (review arm)
  Trigger: C1 arm completes, code ready for review

State: +
